given as<br />\n <em>s</em><sup>7</sup> + 9<em>s</em><sup>6</sup> + 24<em>s</em><sup>5</sup> + 24<em>s</em><sup>4</sup> + 24<em>s</em><sup>3</sup> + 24<em>s</em><sup>7</sup> + 23s + 15 = 0<br />\n then number of roots that lie in RHS of s-plane is ________</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"2","high":"2"},"solution":"<p>\n 2 (2 - 2)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/aba66877edb4f4cb7b90a88786a15edcb2969369.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":27,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>\n Unit step response of second order system is shown in figure</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/bd5b1f56bfc6f279855af874aadd6b3b40c717c7.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n Transfer function of the system is</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/86819defe246088c3c0e04b5c5d3d107e77c5188.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/19f2e5b087e9f032c07f1aefc90aa3821e7c0266.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/2df9a28e97c27a826b31faf34c98ec6501ed972f.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/6b2264cfe083c6d92ee1e984fcacf84ce844c074.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (c)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/f8ba258b147a4be40befeb44c38064b9a55072b7.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":28,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n Transfer function of a second order control system is given as <img src=\"/media/9a24af5e862ada1b6fe2f19a288a29bfbf2df2ce.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> Bandwidth of the system is ________ rad/sec. (upto two decimal places)</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"4.35","high":"5.91"},"solution":"<p>\n 5.372 (4.35 - 5.91)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=